    "name": "Al Sira",
    "steam_appid": 3486230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486230/extras/f5f168508b97dd46f914849227f69728.avif?t=1741863557\" data-has-big width=800 height=301 /></span>Step back in time to explore the remarkable life, teachings, and conduct of Muhammad, the Prophet of Islam, in this immersive narrative-driven puzzle game. Inspired by the acclaimed &quot;Case of the Golden Idol,&quot; this unique experience offers a blend of historical storytelling, mystery-solving, and moral exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a richly detailed world that brings 7th-century Arabia to life through stunning visuals, captivating stories, and challenging puzzles. As a seeker of truth, your mission is to unravel key events, uncover hidden meanings, and piece together the Prophet\u2019s exemplary character through his actions, decisions, and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Historical Mysteries: Solve intricate puzzles based on real events and authentic historical accounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Timeless Legacy: Learn about Muhammad\u2019s principles of compassion, justice, and wisdom through interactive storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Worldbuilding: Experience an era of pivotal change with beautifully crafted environments and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible and Educational: Designed for players of all backgrounds, offering both entertainment and insight into a remarkable life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486230/extras/f5f168508b97dd46f914849227f69728.avif?t=1741863557\" data-has-big width=800 height=301 /></span>Step back in time to explore the remarkable life, teachings, and conduct of Muhammad, the Prophet of Islam, in this immersive narrative-driven puzzle game. Inspired by the acclaimed &quot;Case of the Golden Idol,&quot; this unique experience offers a blend of historical storytelling, mystery-solving, and moral exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a richly detailed world that brings 7th-century Arabia to life through stunning visuals, captivating stories, and challenging puzzles. As a seeker of truth, your mission is to unravel key events, uncover hidden meanings, and piece together the Prophet\u2019s exemplary character through his actions, decisions, and relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Historical Mysteries: Solve intricate puzzles based on real events and authentic historical accounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Timeless Legacy: Learn about Muhammad\u2019s principles of compassion, justice, and wisdom through interactive storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Worldbuilding: Experience an era of pivotal change with beautifully crafted environments and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible and Educational: Designed for players of all backgrounds, offering both entertainment and insight into a remarkable life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Al Sira&quot; is a narrative-driven puzzle game that lets you uncover the life, teachings, and actions of Muhammad, the Prophet of Islam. Solve mysteries, explore key historical events, and piece together his remarkable legacy in this immersive and thought-provoking journey.",
